sequenceDiagram
    actor Founder
    participant Edge as Edge Voice Node
    participant Speech as Speech Adapter
    participant Voice as Voice Orchestrator
    participant Insight as Insight Decision Service
    participant BB as Blackboard
    participant State as Business State Service
    participant TTS as TTS Provider

    Founder->>Edge: Wake word + utterance
    Edge->>Speech: Audio after local activation
    Speech-->>Edge: Transcript + confidence
    Edge->>Voice: VoiceTurnCommand + auth + trace
    Voice->>Voice: Classify bounded intent + resolve references
    alt Low confidence
        Voice-->>Edge: Repeat/clarify response
    else Company health (deterministic path)
        Voice->>Insight: GET company health
        Insight->>State: Latest state/health snapshot
        State-->>Insight: State + freshness + evidence
        Insight-->>Voice: Typed response + trace ID
    else Founder priorities / risks / opportunities (swarm path)
        Voice->>Insight: GET latest brief
        Insight->>BB: Read latest CONVERGED case for brand
        Note over Insight,BB: No live agent debate runs here.<br/>The swarm investigates and converges on its own schedule (see swarm_loop_sequence.mmd).
        BB-->>Insight: Case conclusion, confidence, evidence refs
        Insight-->>Voice: Typed response + case_id + confidence
    end
    Voice->>Speech: Strict rendered text/SSML
    Speech-->>Edge: Audio
    Edge-->>Founder: Spoken answer, confidence disclosed where applicable
